      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "edge-label-navigation"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## Use the graph as an argument\n\nKeep **Idea**, **Problem**, **Audience**, and **Proposed Approach** as singular anchors. Duplicate **Question**, **Assumption**, **Research**, **Evidence**, **Alternative**, **Risk**, and **Next Step** as the investigation grows.\n\nEvidence should support or contradict something specific. Next steps should test an assumption or question and name the evidence they are expected to produce.\n\nSee the adjacent `SKILL.md` before deriving a new graph."
        }
      },
      "handles": [
        {
